(6626738, 989850, 86447, '<td valign="top">Big Government will... until it takes over completely and goes bankrupt.   Then, the people will be left with nothing and will fear for their lives.  They will riot in the streets and physically steal for their existence.  <br/> <br/>After a while... it will all begin again.   <br/> <br/>The people will begin again... and will begin a government again... just giving the government a little.   <br/> <br/>Then, they''ll give them a little more... and before you know it... here we are again.<br/> <br/>Oh!  But... I rant.   Sorry. <br/> <br/> <br/>I do love this image... PERFECT for the challenge.    I can see this being a miniature scene.    Even the colors are wonderful. <br/> <br/> But... alas!  I''m not voting in the challenge.   *sigh*</td>', 'Big Government will... until it takes over completely and goes bankrupt.   Then, the people will be left with nothing and will fear for their lives.  They will riot in the streets and physically steal for their existence.   After a while... it will all begin again.    The people will begin again... and will begin a government again... just giving the government a little.    Then, they''ll give them a little more... and before you know it... here we are again. Oh!  But... I rant.   Sorry.   I do love this image... PERFECT for the challenge.    I can see this being a miniature scene.    Even the colors are wonderful.   But... alas!  I''m not voting in the challenge.   *sigh*', '2011-12-28 00:41:42.000000', NULL, 1),
