(6630871, 989479, 103032, '<td valign="top">This has good foreground and background defocus/blur where I would think the focused portion of the scene is a miniature scene. With that said, I''m spending a lot of time trying to figure out if this is a good example of tilt shift work that has captured a real scene to look like a miniature; or is this a capture of a actual miniature scene.  I''m leaning toward an actual miniature diorama. Whatever the case, this pic fits the tilt shift challenge well, it has the look, it has interest in the scene (people, cars, buildings, etc.) Good luck with the voting.</td>', 'This has good foreground and background defocus/blur where I would think the focused portion of the scene is a miniature scene. With that said, I''m spending a lot of time trying to figure out if this is a good example of tilt shift work that has captured a real scene to look like a miniature; or is this a capture of a actual miniature scene.  I''m leaning toward an actual miniature diorama. Whatever the case, this pic fits the tilt shift challenge well, it has the look, it has interest in the scene (people, cars, buildings, etc.) Good luck with the voting.', '2012-01-01 22:19:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6630877, 989841, 140026, '<td valign="top">really needs a vehicle there near the junction..</td>', 'really needs a vehicle there near the junction..', '2012-01-01 22:22:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6630890, 989526, 103032, '<td valign="top">Of all of the entries, I think this is one of the better submissions.  It has good foreground and background blur that gives the focused portion that miniature look.  The focused portion/subject has action to keep the viewer interested.  With that said, I wonder if the foreground and background DOF could have been lessened just a touch for more context of the scene.  Just a thought. Best wishes on the voting.</td>', 'Of all of the entries, I think this is one of the better submissions.  It has good foreground and background blur that gives the focused portion that miniature look.  The focused portion/subject has action to keep the viewer interested.  With that said, I wonder if the foreground and background DOF could have been lessened just a touch for more context of the scene.  Just a thought. Best wishes on the voting.', '2012-01-01 22:37:50.000000', NULL, 1),
