(6633088, 989747, 12611, '<td valign="top">Looks like a Kinkade painting. great focus.<br/> <br/>edit: It was a compliment, based upon the technique in the photo used,  even though I admittedly can''t stomach Kinkade very much.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2012-01-04 16:18:29.</i></td>', 'Looks like a Kinkade painting. great focus. edit: It was a compliment, based upon the technique in the photo used,  even though I admittedly can''t stomach Kinkade very much.', '2012-01-03 15:04:32.000000', '2012-01-04 16:18:29.000000', 1),
(6633089, 989786, 12611, '<td valign="top">picture perfect postcard to sell in a shop.</td>', 'picture perfect postcard to sell in a shop.', '2012-01-03 15:05:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6633092, 989885, 12611, '<td valign="top">The effect works fair to middling here, but the colors are great, and its great to see a unique perspective of a city.</td>', 'The effect works fair to middling here, but the colors are great, and its great to see a unique perspective of a city.', '2012-01-03 15:11:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6633099, 989877, 12611, '<td valign="top">There is certainly a whimsical quality about this shot- the dead center works.</td>', 'There is certainly a whimsical quality about this shot- the dead center works.', '2012-01-03 15:16:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6633316, 989617, 69446, '<td valign="top">Great angle, and a car park full of cars is perfect for creating the miniature effect. Well done!</td>', 'Great angle, and a car park full of cars is perfect for creating the miniature effect. Well done!', '2012-01-03 17:47:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6633317, 989728, 69446, '<td valign="top">The buildings really look like cardboard cut-outs with a painted backdrop. Nice colours too.</td>', 'The buildings really look like cardboard cut-outs with a painted backdrop. Nice colours too.', '2012-01-03 17:47:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6633331, 989842, 69446, '<td valign="top">For me, the line between the blurred and non-blurred areas of the image is too sharp.. I can literally see it with my eye, and that creates an unnatural look to the image. Personally, I think a softer ramp from sharp to non-sharp would be less distracting.</td>', 'For me, the line between the blurred and non-blurred areas of the image is too sharp.. I can literally see it with my eye, and that creates an unnatural look to the image. Personally, I think a softer ramp from sharp to non-sharp would be less distracting.', '2012-01-03 18:01:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6633335, 989753, 69446, '<td valign="top">My favourite entry for this challenge... I''ll be surprised if you don''t ribbon with this one. Great caption too!</td>', 'My favourite entry for this challenge... I''ll be surprised if you don''t ribbon with this one. Great caption too!', '2012-01-03 18:05:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6633336, 989786, 69446, '<td valign="top">Great idea and execution, one of my favourite for the challenge. I''ll be surprised if you don''t ribbon with this!</td>', 'Great idea and execution, one of my favourite for the challenge. I''ll be surprised if you don''t ribbon with this!', '2012-01-03 18:06:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6633337, 989872, 69446, '<td valign="top">Interesting effect, here... you''ve really managed to create the "miniature" look without being miles away from the subject. I like it.</td>', 'Interesting effect, here... you''ve really managed to create the "miniature" look without being miles away from the subject. I like it.', '2012-01-03 18:06:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6633338, 989469, 69446, '<td valign="top">Different to many of the other entries (which create the "fake miniature" effect), but I like it. Nice composition.</td>', 'Different to many of the other entries (which create the "fake miniature" effect), but I like it. Nice composition.', '2012-01-03 18:06:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6633339, 989792, 69446, '<td valign="top">The train and house on the hill look great, it''s a pity so much of your background has to be blurred to create the tilt shift effect. I''d suggest trying a tighter crop, the sky and the top of the hill don''t add much to the image. Overall, nice job.</td>', 'The train and house on the hill look great, it''s a pity so much of your background has to be blurred to create the tilt shift effect. I''d suggest trying a tighter crop, the sky and the top of the hill don''t add much to the image. Overall, nice job.', '2012-01-03 18:07:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6633342, 989857, 69446, '<td valign="top">Cute effect on the bridge; for me, I think a slightly tighter crop to remove some of the river may have improved the image.</td>', 'Cute effect on the bridge; for me, I think a slightly tighter crop to remove some of the river may have improved the image.', '2012-01-03 18:08:54.000000', NULL, 1),
