(6633953, 989796, 135629, '<td valign="top">+1, I agree with the comments from spiritualspatula. Not to say it''s a bad image, as it is plenty pretty just don''t think it has the miniature feel the heavy hitters did. I see this image and the first thing I do is think it has nice colors and is a nice photo of a sailboat, when I look at the winning top tilt shift images i find myself getting close to the monitor to see if they are actually pictures of a miniature model or not because the illusion is crazy, make sense?</td>', '+1, I agree with the comments from spiritualspatula. Not to say it''s a bad image, as it is plenty pretty just don''t think it has the miniature feel the heavy hitters did. I see this image and the first thing I do is think it has nice colors and is a nice photo of a sailboat, when I look at the winning top tilt shift images i find myself getting close to the monitor to see if they are actually pictures of a miniature model or not because the illusion is crazy, make sense?', '2012-01-04 00:56:29.000000', NULL, 0),
