(6633999, 989796, 98022, '<td valign="top">I agree overall with spiritualspatula and ShutterRev. While a very nice seascape, it does not have the miniaturization feel that most voters were expecting. A higher viewpoint and possibly more objects in the frame would help on this regard. The smoothness of the water and sky obscure the blurring effect also.</td>', 'I agree overall with spiritualspatula and ShutterRev. While a very nice seascape, it does not have the miniaturization feel that most voters were expecting. A higher viewpoint and possibly more objects in the frame would help on this regard. The smoothness of the water and sky obscure the blurring effect also.', '2012-01-04 01:23:11.000000', NULL, 0),
