(6634083, 989714, 109387, '<td valign="top">You didn''t deserve such low score but still the blur in this image doesn''t work and it''s not a matter of non miniature. IMHO this kind of blur doesn''t match with water, it creates a strange view, especially because you transition was too hard. But surely i can be wrong.</td>', 'You didn''t deserve such low score but still the blur in this image doesn''t work and it''s not a matter of non miniature. IMHO this kind of blur doesn''t match with water, it creates a strange view, especially because you transition was too hard. But surely i can be wrong.', '2012-01-04 03:00:29.000000', NULL, 0),
