(6634212, 989786, 137576, '<td valign="top">5 from me, doesnt look like the "tilt shidt effect" looks like a lens baby or iphone app etc <br/> <br/>the massive white border? why? if i want to see white i can look at an A4 sheet of paper 10% of your image is given over to it<br/> <br/>yeah its a surfer cresting a wave, but its far away and no detail. the blur effect steals from the sky and the waves, doesnt grab me or draw me in , meh 5 next image.....<br/> <br/>also for this challenge ppl dont work well i feel, and slightly raised viewpoint like you are looking down onto the model this is level and at eye line. <br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2012-01-04 07:37:08.</i></td>', '5 from me, doesnt look like the "tilt shidt effect" looks like a lens baby or iphone app etc  the massive white border? why? if i want to see white i can look at an A4 sheet of paper 10% of your image is given over to it yeah its a surfer cresting a wave, but its far away and no detail. the blur effect steals from the sky and the waves, doesnt grab me or draw me in , meh 5 next image..... also for this challenge ppl dont work well i feel, and slightly raised viewpoint like you are looking down onto the model this is level and at eye line. ', '2012-01-04 07:35:33.000000', '2012-01-04 07:37:08.000000', 0),
