(6635447, 989847, 30364, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by bspurgeon:</b></div><hr/><i> Paul, is that port in the background? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>It''s Cape Town''s main commercial shipping port visible in the background.  Also Table Mountain on the left (mostly offstage), Lion''s Head centre, and Signal Hill to the right.  It''s a full house.</td>', 'Originally posted by bspurgeon: Paul, is that port in the background?   It''s Cape Town''s main commercial shipping port visible in the background.  Also Table Mountain on the left (mostly offstage), Lion''s Head centre, and Signal Hill to the right.  It''s a full house.', '2012-01-05 02:45:57.000000', NULL, 0),
