(6636393, 989847, 96751, '<td valign="top">Escapism.  Exuberance.  Irrationality.  The tickle at the base of the brain when we remember a spectacular moment of joy in our lives.  A most splendid vision.</td>', 'Escapism.  Exuberance.  Irrationality.  The tickle at the base of the brain when we remember a spectacular moment of joy in our lives.  A most splendid vision.', '2012-01-06 00:54:58.000000', NULL, 0),
