(6636998, 989847, 113142, '<td valign="top">Haunting. This is by far the most beautiful image of the bunch, I keep thinking about it even at work! In a challenge full of what I consider DNMC (IMHO, because not one TS-E lens was used and all effects were PP), this one stands out because it does not seem to take a feeble attempt at faking the funk. Just a lovely image, stays with the viewer, captures interest (I was forced to look up the title, "beautiful game," right? and though generally in reference to football to hell with that I think this better exemplifies the phrase!), stirs the imagination, and evokes powerful memories of childhood fancy and whim. Art in every sense, thank you for sharing your vision with us. You remind us what photography is all about. I''m sorry I didn''t vote because if I did you would have one more 10.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2012-01-06 16:31:37.</i></td>', 'Haunting. This is by far the most beautiful image of the bunch, I keep thinking about it even at work! In a challenge full of what I consider DNMC (IMHO, because not one TS-E lens was used and all effects were PP), this one stands out because it does not seem to take a feeble attempt at faking the funk. Just a lovely image, stays with the viewer, captures interest (I was forced to look up the title, "beautiful game," right? and though generally in reference to football to hell with that I think this better exemplifies the phrase!), stirs the imagination, and evokes powerful memories of childhood fancy and whim. Art in every sense, thank you for sharing your vision with us. You remind us what photography is all about. I''m sorry I didn''t vote because if I did you would have one more 10.', '2012-01-06 16:28:58.000000', '2012-01-06 16:31:37.000000', 0),
(6637685, 989891, 86447, '<td valign="top">I''m back to tell you how clever and funny I think your title is.    Very.  :D<br/></td>', 'I''m back to tell you how clever and funny I think your title is.    Very.  :D', '2012-01-07 13:06:41.000000', NULL, 0),
